{"title":"Lycan","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 24 Werewolf that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (1.1% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/lycan-claw\">Lycan Claw</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/lycan\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/lycan?lv=24\">Lv 24</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/lycan?lv=30\">Lv 30 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/lycan?lv=31\">Lv 31 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/lycan?lv=32\">Lv 32 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/lycan?lv=33\">Lv 33 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/lycan?lv=24\" title=\"Pick level 24\"><td><b>24</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>84</td><td>17.7</td><td>1,200</td><td class=\"muted\">252 · 24.8 · 3,600</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/lycan?lv=30\" title=\"Pick level 30\"><td><b>30</b></td><td>118</td><td>21</td><td>1,500</td><td class=\"muted\">354 · 29.4 · 4,500</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/lycan?lv=31\" title=\"Pick level 31\"><td><b>31</b></td><td>124</td><td>21.6</td><td>1,550</td><td class=\"muted\">372 · 30.2 · 4,650</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/lycan?lv=32\" title=\"Pick level 32\"><td><b>32</b></td><td>131</td><td>22.1</td><td>1,600</td><td class=\"muted\">393 · 30.9 · 4,800</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/lycan?lv=33\" title=\"Pick level 33\"><td><b>33</b></td><td>137</td><td>22.7</td><td>1,650</td><td class=\"muted\">411 · 31.8 · 4,950</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 102 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 102 looted corpses, 214 recorded drops, 4,795 total, 4–96 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/102</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"werewolf-pelt\" title=\"Werewolf Pelt - in 100% of 102 looted corpses, 101 recorded drops, 101 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ef6770c8d1b158c56195.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolf Pelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 102/102</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"lycan-claw\" title=\"Lycan Claw - in 58% of 102 looted corpses, 59 recorded drops, 122 total, 1–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/5886e8298d88b1961766.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Lycan Claw</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">58% · 59/102</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-arms\" title=\"Silver Arms - in 3% of 102 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/0df60d482adab9e8f138.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">3% · 3/102</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"werewolf-pelt\" title=\"Werewolf Pelt - in 100% of 102 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ef6770c8d1b158c56195.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolf Pelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 102/102</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Moonfang&#39;s Lair</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 2</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-151\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1391.9px,-760.1px)\"><img src=\"tiles/3/4/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:512px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/4/3.png\" 